### Test FootballIQ Scraper Endpoints

### 1. Trigger a manual scrape (fetches live data from ESPN and stores in DB)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fixtures/sync-now
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Get all fixtures from cached DB
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fixtures

### 3. Get fixtures for Premier League only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fixtures/league/eng.1

### 4. Get fixtures for La Liga
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fixtures/league/esp.1

### 5. Get fixtures for Champions League
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fixtures/league/uefa.champions